        "CopyrightInformation": "©2017 American Association for Cancer Research.",
        "AbstractText": "Interim data from the MONARCH3 study indicate that abemaciclib is an effective first-line therapy for advanced ER-positive, HER2-negative breast cancer. Adding the investigational CDK4/6 inhibitor to letrozole significantly improved patients' progression-free survival, compared with those given a placebo alongside endocrine therapy."
